                "line": 140,
                "quote": "| Ok [ \"backup\"; path ] -> Backups.backup ports path |> render showBackup"
              },
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Application/Backups.fs",
                "line": 21,
                "quote": "ports.Archive.Save path library"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Every new effect goes through an existing port: Files.ReadLines for the existence check, Archive.Load/Save for backups, Store.Load/Save for state. No effect was added in Tier 1/2. The change also removes a direct persistence use from presentation: the old CLI called `(JsonFileStore.create path).Save(...)` and had `open Lending.Host.Persistence` (both lines removed). Reading the whole file to test whether it exists is clumsy, but it still goes through a port.",
