                "quote": "let private noBackupAt (path: string) = InvalidInput $\"no backup at {path}\""
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Each fact has one definition that all uses reference. The library summary is defined once (Views.summary, rendered once by showSummary) and used by backup, restore and backup-info. The member balance comes from Accounts.owed and is formatted with the existing money function. The missing-backup error is defined once and used by both info and restore. No literal or predicate is copied.",
