            "rationale": "The restore-member rule lives in a pure Tier 2 function, Accounts.restoreMember. That rule covers which member is taken, the refusal when the backup lacks the member, the refusal when the member already exists (via Catalog.addMember), and bringing fines and payments but not loans, holds or reminders. Tier 3 only loads, calls and saves, and the CLI only dispatches and renders a view.",
